===form===
container for different types(text fields,checkboxes, radio buttons, submit buttons)
<input type=submit> submitting the form data to a form-handler."The form-handler is typically a file on the server with a script for processing input data."
لو نسيتي تكتبي name في الـ input، القيمة اللي المستخدم يدخلها لن تُرسل للسيرفر.

• The target attribute specifies where to display the response that is received after submitting the form
_blank :displayed in a new window or tab
_self : current window
_parent :  displayed in the parent frame
_top : displayed in the full body of the window
framename :displayed in a named iframe
*****default HTTP method GET.********

NEVER use GET to send sensitive data! data is visible in the URL!
URL is limited (2048 character)
Useful for bookmark the result
GET is good for non-secure data, like query strings in Google

==post==
no size limitations send large amounts
POST cannot be bookmarked
