User Defined Functions
:is a block of statements
not execute automatically when page load 
will be executed by a call to the function
function name: must start with a letter or an underscore.
 Function names :NOT case-sensitive
 declare(strict_types=1); This must be on the very first line of the PHP file
 لو ضفت رقم جوه "" او نوع مختلف من الداتا تيب عن اللى كتباه فالفانكشن و هي موجوده هتديني  fatal error 

